{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJVTLzS4dDupASB2Uij4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, a prudent agent exists, and depth 2 is the minimum. I wrote the answer to `/work/answer.md` and created `/work/SUBMIT`.\n\n**Agent.** `FORMULA: B(a) & B(B(F) | ~d)`, which is □a ∧ □(□⊥ ∨ ¬d) at depth 2. This is PrudentBot. `check.py` reports it prudent: it defects against CooperateBot and DefectBot, and it cooperates with FairBot, with FairBot replying C, and with itself.\n\n**Why nothing smaller works.**\n- **Depth 0:** such a formula has no atoms, so it is just ⊤ or ⊥. ⊤ cooperates with CooperateBot and ⊥ defects against FairBot.\n- **Depth 1:** the proof covers formulas of any size, with any number of boxes.\n  - Against CooperateBot, every atom is true at every world. From world 1 on, X's action is therefore a fixed value, φ[ψᵢ(111)]. Prudence requires that value to be D.\n  - Against FairBot, world 0 has FairBot's atoms (a, c, d) all true, because its a at world 0 is vacuously true and c is always true. At world 1, X's boxes therefore evaluate exactly as they do against CooperateBot, so X defects at world 1.\n  - That makes FairBot defect against X from world 2 on. So X cannot be prudent.\n- This uses only the CooperateBot and FairBot conditions. A depth-1 agent cannot tell FairBot from CooperateBot at world 1, and the d-atom in the depth-2 formula is what separates them.\n\nI did not characterize all depth-2 prudent agents or bound their minimal size. `answer.md` says so."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3506,"cache_read_input_tokens":20576,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3506,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":591,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8c150ec8-be66-4478-b5ef-415d2d4f41c3","uuid":"b5af9a99-95ec-47b2-8251-f15e5eeb6e4c","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:53:14.703Z","request_id":"req_011CgJVTLeqpygRNkzur6mQz"}
